  "content": "<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;color:#f1c40f\"><strong>后室·进化</strong></span></h1><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">后室·进化是一款整合包，包含《<span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffr.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fThe_Backrooms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">后室</a></strong></span>》中那些令人焦虑的阈限空间。它包含5个层级，每个层级都有只想杀死你的怪物。借助<strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/essential-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">ESSENTIAL MOD</a></span></strong>，你可以进行多人游戏。此整合包在<strong><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><a style=\"color:#f1c40f\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fminecraft-found-footage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft Found Footage</a></span></strong>基础模组（由<strong><span style=\"color:#169179\"><a style=\"color:#169179\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSpacePotato\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">SpacePotato</a></span></strong>制作）之上进行了优化。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">它增加了真实的摄像机移动和动画、手电筒、耐力条以及沉浸式环境音效。</span></p><p><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>6个层级：<br></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>1.层级0&nbsp;----------------------&nbsp;<em>我们熟知且深爱的后室</em></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#34495e\"><strong>2.层级1&nbsp;----------------------&nbsp;<em>宜居区</em></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#fbeeb8\"><strong>3.层级324&nbsp;-------------------&nbsp;<em>被遗忘的车站</em></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>4.层级2 ---------------------- <em>管道之梦</em></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><strong>5.泳池室 ------------- <em>泳池室</em>&nbsp;O.o</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong>6.无限草地 ---- <em>这个不太一样</em></strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>注意</strong></span>：此整合包无需额外光影，因为光影已整合进模组中</span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
